eject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,40,74,87,77,75],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"13100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1012305","helmet":"WP1022505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,40,74,87,77,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1012305","helmet":"WP1022505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,40,74,87,77,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1012305","helmet":"WP1022505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"原为陈郡官吏，为人清廉节俭，后任县令。曹操击败了归降又叛的高干后，将梁习设为并州刺史。匈奴各族对并州进行骚扰期间，梁习劝降多族，在州内为他们提供官职，同时向魏国举荐了多名前来避难的名士，使并州得以顺利发展。后入朝担任大司农，据传当时的政绩无人可比。","tc":"原為陳郡官吏，為人清廉節儉，后任縣令。曹操擊敗了歸降又叛的高干后，將梁習設為并州刺史。匈奴各族對并州進行騷擾期間，梁習勸降多族，在州內為他們提供官職，同時向魏國舉薦了多名前來避難的名士，使并州得以順利發展。后入朝擔任大司農，據傳當時的政績無人可比。","en":"Originally a minor official of Chen Commandery, known for his integrity and frugality, he later served as a Magistrate. After Cao Cao defeated the renegade Gao Gan, he appointed Liang Xi as Lt. Governor of Bing Province. During the period when various Xiongnu tribes harassed Bing Province, Liang Xi persuaded many tribes to submit, offered them official positions within the province, and recommended numerous prominent scholars who had sought refuge there. Under his governance, Bing Province developed smoothly. He was later recalled to the capital to serve as Sub-chancellor, and it was said that no one could match his administrative achievements at the time.","jp":"もとは陳郡の役人で、人柄は清廉倹約であり、のちに県令を務めた。曹操が降伏後に再び叛いた高幹を討つと、梁習は並州刺史に任じられた。匈奴の諸部族が並州を脅かしていた際には、梁習は多くの部族を帰順させて州内の官職を与え、同時に避難してきた多くの名士を魏に推挙したことで、並州の発展に大きく貢献した。のちに朝廷に入って大司農を務め、当時の治績は並ぶ者がいなかったと伝えられている。","kr":"본래 진군의 관리였으며 청렴하고 검소한 인품으로 훗날 현령을 지냈다. 조조가 항복했다가 다시 반기를 든 고간을 토벌한 뒤 양습을 병주자사로 삼았다. 흉노의 여러 부족이 병주를 침탈하며 소란을 피우자, 양습은 여러 부족을 설득해 귀순시킨 뒤 주 안에서 관직을 제수하였고 피난 온 여러 명사를 위나라에 천거하여 병주를 안정적으로 발전시켰다. 훗날 조정에 들어가 대사농을 지냈는데, 당시 그의 치적에 비견할 자가 없었다고 전해진다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10581","remark":"","surname":"梁","surnameTc":"梁","surnameEn":"Liang","surnameJp":"梁","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"习","nameTc":"習","nameEn":"Xi","nameJp":"習","nameKr":"습","nameOther":"","word":"子虞","wordTc":"子虞","wordEn":"Ziyu","wordJp":"子虞","wordKr":"자우","wordOther":"","icon":"梁习","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"187","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"40","wise":"74","politics":"87","charm":"77","will":"75","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"13","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"10/10/51/10/10/44/50/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"1600","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"1001301","strategy2":"1007301","professions":"0/0/3/0/3/0/2/2/3/3/0/0/0/2/0/3/2/1/0/1/1/0/0/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"22","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2700","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"168","show":"187","death":"230","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1012305","helmet":"WP1022505","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;15/1;21/1;23/1;27/1;29/1;39/1;42/1;44/1","father":"","mother":"",